      "content": "these are okay i guess, but some of them feel a little forced. like in question 2, asking about \"creating synergy\" sounds a bit like corporate jargon that people would just fake an answer to. \n\ncan you try a second set of 5 questions? try to make them feel even more natural and less like they're checking off a list. i still need that script to pick up the themes though, so make sure the themes are still in there, i just don't want the questions to sound weird or repetitive.",
